# VLM-NSM 项目总览

> 更新时间：2026-05-31 | 测试：1589 passed, 2 skipped | 论文整合：[stage24_r](generated/results/stage24_r_paper_consolidation/)

## 项目定位

**课题**: 语言引导的机器人堆叠系统。Language→Symbolic Planning→Skill Execution 全链路。

**当前里程碑** (2026-06-01):
- Language→Symbolic 链路可靠 (100%)
- Perception→Control bridge 打通 (Live YOLO+stereo, 85%)
- Learned executor 诊断完成 (分布偏移根因明确)
- 残余瓶颈: cube2 (5cm green) grasp

## 实验结论 (当前)

| 层 | 方法 | 最佳结果 |
|----|------|---------|
| Language→Symbolic | Qwen + Alignment | **100%** (Parse50=51/51, E2E10=10/10) |
| Perception→Control | Scripted + Live YOLO | **85%** (red 100%, green 70%) |
| Skill Execution (Oracle) | Scripted Controller | **77.5%** (red 95%, green 50-67%) |
| Skill Execution | BC LSTM + DAgger Iter2 | 0% success, **80% ever_lift** |
| Skill Execution | PPO warm-start | 0% (技能崩溃) |
| Skill Execution | ACT-lite | 0% |

**关键结论**: Scripted 77.5% 是当前方法的实际上限。Learned 方法提供分布偏移诊断价值但未超越 scripted baseline。Cube2 (5cm green) grasp 是主要残余瓶颈。

