## Stage 7B-1: MLP Behavior Cloning (Experimental) — 2026-05-14

### 目标
训练 MLP BC policy 作为 baseline，与 scripted policy 对比，验证 BC pipeline 完整性。

### 数据集
- Source: 87 条 strict success 演示轨迹，合并为单 npz (87,231 steps)
- Obs key: `filtered_obs` (11-dim), Action: 7-dim
- Train/val split: 90/10 episodes (78,095 / 9,136 steps)

### 训练
- Model: MLP(11 → 256 → 256 → 7), 70,663 params
- Epochs: 150, Batch: 256, LR: 1e-3
- Train loss: 0.377 → 0.041
- Val loss: 0.226 → 0.043 (best)
- Training time: 473s (CPU)

### 评估 (20 episodes in robosuite)
| Metric           | BC Policy | Scripted Policy (Stage 7A-12) |
|------------------|-----------|-------------------------------|
| Episode Success  | 0%        | 96%                           |
| Mean Steps       | 1000      | 856                           |
| p95 Steps        | 1000      | 892                           |

### 分析
BC policy 在长 horizon 任务上失败（distribution shift + 部分 action dim 零方差），说明：
1. 简单的 MLP BC 无法处理 ~860 步的精确操控
2. dim 3-5 (orientation) 恒为零，归一化后产生数值不稳定
3. 需要更高级的 imitation learning 方法（DAgger, 观察过滤等）

### 生成的文件
- Model: `generated/results/stage_7B-1/bc_policy.pt`
- Results: `generated/results/stage_7B-1/` (6 files)
- Report: `generated/report_tables/stage_7B-1/bc_stage7b1_report.md`
- Demo trajectories: `generated/demos/stage_7B-1/` (npz + meta.json)

