### B5: 失败分析

**DAgger Reach BC 失败统计（110 episodes）:**

| Seed | Ep | Failure Stage | Steps | BC Steps | Failure Type | BC Phase Involved? |
|:----:|:--:|:-------------|:----:|:--------:|:------------:|:------------------:|
| 0 | 11 | horizon | 664 | 86 | horizon (BC stuck early) | Yes — low BC steps suggests reach_pick failure |
| 1 | 10 | preplace | 707 | 492 | preplace | Partially — placement target perturbed by BC |
| 1 | 20 | horizon | 696 | 118 | horizon (BC stuck reach_pick) | Yes |
| 2 | 12 | horizon | 660 | 82 | horizon (BC stuck reach_pick) | Yes |
| 50ep | 6 | preplace | 732 | 518 | preplace | Partially |
| 50ep | 12 | horizon | 667 | 89 | horizon (BC stuck reach_pick) | Yes |
| 50ep | 29 | preplace | 1000 | 246 | preplace (horizon during place) | Partially |
| 50ep | 49 | preplace | 728 | 513 | preplace | Partially |

**失败审计摘要:**

| Failure Type | DAgger (60ep) | DAgger (50ep) | bc_main (60ep) | 解读 |
|:------------:|:-------------:|:-------------:|:--------------:|------|
| horizon | 3 | 1 | 8 | DAgger 减少 horizon 失败约 62-75% |
| preplace | 1 | 3 | 0 | Preplace 是 DAgger 的独特失败模式（放置检查失败） |

**根因分析:**
  - **低 BC steps（<120）的 Horizon 失败**：BC 在 reach_pick 早期停滞，未能在超时前到达 grasp
  - **Preplace 失败**：放置位置稍有偏差，scripted phase 问题，非 BC 导致
  - **bc_main 失败**：全部为 horizon（比 DAgger 多 4-5 倍），reach phase 中存在系统性 covariate shift

  - **建议:** Preplace 非 BC 问题。针对早期失败状态的 DAgger round 2 可能有助于改善

Output: `generated/report_tables/stage_7B-5/dagger_failure_audit.md`

