| 策略 | 条件 |
|:-----|:------|
| expected_bindings_match | 提供 expected_bindings 且非空 |
| scene_inference | 有 scene_info 但无 expected_bindings |
| none | 无 scene_info |

辅助函数：_resolve_color_from_instruction、_resolve_positions_from_instruction

