## Stage 17.1: 场景感知 Qwen 实验验证（2026-05-21）

### 目标

执行真实 DashScope API 调用的 scene grounding 解析评估，验证 oracle scene
inventory 在 object grounding 中的实际效果。

### S17.1-A: 场景感知解析评估（无场景）

脚本：`scripts/run_dashscope_scene_grounding_without_scene.sh`

```text
DashScope qwen3.6-plus, --scene_inventory none
45/45 parse_ok, schema_valid, alignment, target_stack, planner — 全部通过
object_grounding_valid: 0/45 (N/A — 无场景)
```

输出：`generated/results/stage_17/scene_grounding_without_scene/`

### S17.1-A: 场景感知解析评估（Oracle 场景）

脚本：`scripts/run_dashscope_scene_grounding_with_oracle.sh`

```text
DashScope qwen3.6-plus, --scene_inventory oracle
45/45 parse_ok, schema_valid, alignment, target_stack, planner — 全部通过
object_grounding_valid: 43/45 (95.6%)
object_grounding_fail: 2/45 (4.4%)
```

失败原因：
1. "Put the lighter colored cube on the darker one." — 颜色模糊（红 vs 绿亮度）
2. "Stack the yellow cube on the red cube." — 对抗性，黄色不存在于场景中

输出：`generated/results/stage_17/dashscope_scene_grounding_with_oracle/`

### S17.1-B: 比较脚本

新增 `src/vlm_nsm/experiments/compare_scene_grounding_results.py`
测试：`tests/test_compare_scene_grounding_results.py`（13 测试）

```text
nsm/bin/python -m vlm_nsm.experiments.compare_scene_grounding_results \
  --without_scene ... --with_oracle ... --input ... --output ...

Scene Grounding Comparison
Metric                          Without     With    Delta
total                                45       45       +0
parse_ok                             45       45       +0
schema_valid                         45       45       +0
alignment_success                    45       45       +0
planner_success                      45       45       +0
fully_successful                     45       45       +0
object_grounding_valid                0       43      +43
object_grounding_fail                 0        2       +2
```

Per-category: positional 8/8, referential 8/8, chinese 9/9, color 14/15, adversarial 4/5

