## Stage 18-B: YOLOv8n Training + RGB Detector Pipeline（2026-05-21）

### 安装依赖 (被中断的 uv 进程 → pip)

```text
uv pip install ultralytics → 被中断（卡在 ~500MB CUDA 下载）
→ pip install torch torchvision --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128
→ pip install matplotlib polars ultralytics-thop
最终：torch 2.11.0+cu128, ultralytics 8.4.52, 8×RTX4090
```

### YOLOv8n 训练 (Smoke Dataset)

```text
Model: YOLOv8n (pretrained, 3.0M params)
Data: 80 train / 20 val (512×512, 3 classes: red_cube, green_cube, blue_cube)
Epochs: 50, Batch: 16, GPU: RTX 4090 (device 4)
Time: 43 seconds (0.012 hours)

Results:
  mAP50:     0.483
  mAP50-95:  0.437
  Precision: 0.293
  Recall:    1.0
  GPU mem:   1.3 GB

Output: generated/models/rgb_perception_yolov8n_smoke/weights/best.pt (6.0 MB)
```

### Stage 18-B2: Medium Dataset & YOLOv8n Medium Training

```text
Medium dataset: generated/datasets/rgb_perception_v0_1_medium/
├── images/train/       # 2000 PNG (512×512)
├── images/val/         # 500 PNG (512×512)
├── labels/train/       # 4000 YOLO .txt (2 objects per image)
├── labels/val/         # 1000 YOLO .txt
├── annotations.jsonl   # merged train+val
├── dataset_meta.json
└── yolo.yaml           # nc=2: red_cube(0), green_cube(1)

bbox_source: segmentation (sim.render segmentation channels → pixel-accurate bbox)
Class balance: red_cube=2500 (50%), green_cube=2500 (50%)
Bbox size: width ~49.7px (0.097 norm), height ~60.8px (0.119 norm) at 512×512

YOLOv8n medium training:
  Model: YOLOv8n (pretrained, 3.0M params, 8.1 GFLOPs)
  Data: 2000 train / 500 val (512×512, 2 classes: red_cube, green_cube)
  Epochs: 68 (patience=50, best at epoch 18), Batch: 16
  Optimizer: AdamW (auto-detected by ultralytics, lr0 overridden)
  GPU: RTX 4090 (device 4)
  Time: 0.262 hours (~24s/epoch)
  AMP: False (disabled to prevent OOM from yolo26n.pt side-load)

Results:
  mAP50:     0.990
  mAP50-95:  0.987
  Precision: 0.993
  Recall:    0.993
  red_cube AP50:   0.988
  green_cube AP50: 0.993

Output: generated/models/rgb_perception_yolov8n_medium/best.pt (6.0 MB)
Threshold sweep: generated/detection/yolov8n_medium/threshold_sweep.json
  Optimal conf: 0.25 (by max F1)

Note: smoke model (mAP50=0.483) trained on 100 images with 3 classes (including
blue_cube, which never appears in val). Medium model (mAP50=0.990) trained on
2500 images with 2 classes. The jump from 0.483 → 0.990 is driven by 25× more
data and the removal of the zero-shot blue_cube class.
```

### RGBDetectorPerception 验证

```text
Detector: best.pt
Conf=0.15: 10/10 val images detect red (0.34-0.48) + green (0.21-0.30) cubes
Conf=0.25: 9/10 detect red cube, 0/10 detect green (threshold too high)
```

### Eval Pipeline 集成

`src/vlm_nsm/experiments/eval_online_qwen_parser.py`:
- 新增 `--scene_inventory rgb_detector` 选项
- 新增 `--detector_model_path`, `--detector_conf_threshold`, `--dataset_root` 参数
- 支持从 `image_path` 加载 RGB 图像 → YOLO 推理 → SceneInfo → scene_description
- Object grounding evaluation 同时支持 oracle 和 rgb_detector 模式

