| 指标 | 数值 |
|------|------|
| Overall success | **21/40 (52.5%)** |
| red_on_green | 14/20 (70.0%) |
| green_on_red | **7/20 (35.0%)** |
| Unsafe leaks | 0 |
| Runtime errors | 0 |

Failure taxonomy:
- timeout: 11 (BC reach_pick 未能在 horizon 内到达抓取位)
- grasp_failure: 5
