### Stage 19-D5: Cube2 Grasp/Place Robustness Engineering (2026-05-28)

**目标**: 在不改 canonical config/checkpoint、不训练 BC/ACT、不运行 Qwen/DashScope 的前提下，为 scripted-only executor 增加 runtime-only profile 机制，并聚合 cube2/green_on_red 失败诊断，验证是否能把 scripted-only overall 提升到 >=80%。

**D5-1: Cube2 failure diagnostics 聚合**

新增脚本：

```text
src/vlm_nsm/experiments/stage19_d5_analyze_cube2_failures.py
```

输入：

```text
generated/results/stage_19/stage19_r1c_scripted_40_diagnostics.jsonl
generated/results/stage_19/stage19_d2_reverse_collection_episodes.jsonl
generated/results/stage_19/stage19_d4_fallback_diagnostics.jsonl
```

输出：

```text
generated/results/stage_19/stage19_d5_cube2_failure_analysis.json
generated/results/stage_19/stage19_d5_cube2_failure_analysis.md
```

聚合结果：

| Metric | Value |
|--------|------:|
| Input rows | 180 |
| green_on_red cube2 failure rows | 44 |
| inferred grasp phase | 34 |
| inferred reach_place/place phase | 10 |

Failure reasons:

| Reason | Count |
|--------|------:|
| grasp_failure | 24 |
| unknown | 10 |
| place_failure | 8 |
| timeout | 2 |

建议：

```text
adjust_grasp_height
adjust_gripper_width
adjust_place_height
add_stabilization_steps
improve_failure_labeling
```

**D5-2: Runtime-only scripted profiles**

修改：

```text
src/vlm_nsm/experiments/stage19_run_symbolic_rollouts.py
src/vlm_nsm/experiments/run_embodied_stacking_robosuite.py
```

新增 CLI：

```text
--scripted_profile default|cube2_grasp_lower|cube2_place_higher|cube2_robust
```

Profile 行为：

| Profile | Scope | Effect |
|---------|-------|--------|
| default | all objects | 完全保持原行为 |
| cube2_grasp_lower | cube2/green_cube only | grasp target/descend z lower by 0.003m |
| cube2_place_higher | cube2/green_cube only | preplace +0.010m, release/descend +0.005m, hold +10 steps |
| cube2_robust | cube2/green_cube only | combine grasp lower + place higher |

诊断字段：

```text
scripted_profile
grasp_z_offset
place_z_offset
release_z_offset
stabilization_steps
profile_applied_to_object
```

重要约束：

```text
default profile offsets 全为 0；
cube2 profiles 只在 resolved_top 为 cube2/green_cube 时生效；
canonical execution config 不写回、不覆盖；
canonical checkpoints 未修改；
Qwen/DashScope 未运行；
BC/ACT 未训练。
```

**D5-3/D5-4: Eval 输入与运行脚本**

新增 eval input：

```text
generated/eval_inputs/stage_19/stage19_d5_green_on_red_20.json
generated/eval_inputs/stage_19/stage19_d5_scripted_best_profile_eval_40.json
```

新增运行脚本：

```text
scripts/run_stage19_d5_profile_sweep.sh
scripts/run_stage19_d5_best_profile_eval.sh
```

新增报告生成器：

```text
src/vlm_nsm/experiments/stage19_d5_profile_report.py
```

生成报告：

```text
generated/results/stage_19/stage19_d5_profile_sweep.md
generated/results/stage_19/stage19_d5_best_profile_eval_report.md
```

实际仿真命令：

```bash
MUJOCO_GL=egl PYTHON_BIN=nsm/bin/python bash scripts/run_stage19_d5_profile_sweep.sh
SCRIPTED_PROFILE=cube2_robust MUJOCO_GL=egl PYTHON_BIN=nsm/bin/python bash scripts/run_stage19_d5_best_profile_eval.sh
```

**D5-3: Profile sweep on green_on_red 20**

| Profile | Success | Grasp Fail | Place Fail | Timeout | Unsafe | Runtime errors |
|---------|--------:|-----------:|-----------:|--------:|-------:|---------------:|
| default | 13/20 (65.0%) | 7 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| cube2_grasp_lower | 14/20 (70.0%) | 6 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| cube2_place_higher | 12/20 (60.0%) | 8 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| **cube2_robust** | **15/20 (75.0%)** | **5** | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |

结论：

```text
cube2_robust 是最优 profile。
grasp_lower 单独有效（65%→70%），place_higher 单独无效（60%），组合后达到 green_on_red 75%。
```

**D5-4: Best-profile 40 episode eval**

Profile:

```text
cube2_robust
```

结果：

| Metric | Value |
|--------|------:|
| Overall | **32/40 (80.0%)** |
| red_on_green | **18/20 (90.0%)** |
| green_on_red | **14/20 (70.0%)** |
| Unsafe leaks | 0 |
| Runtime errors | 0 |

Failure taxonomy:

```text
none=32
grasp_failure=5
timeout=2
place_failure=1
```

对比：

| Executor | red_on_green | green_on_red | Overall | Verdict |
|----------|-------------:|-------------:|--------:|---------|
| R1c scripted-only default | 85.0% | 60.0% | 72.5% | prior best |
| D4 BC+fallback | 75.0% | 45.0% | 60.0% | partial |
| **D5 cube2_robust scripted** | **90.0%** | **70.0%** | **80.0%** | **PARTIAL_PASS / best** |

D5 criteria:

```text
unsafe leaks = 0 ✅
runtime errors = 0 ✅
overall >= 80% ✅
red_on_green >= 80% ✅
green_on_red >= 75% ❌ (70%)
```

所以 D5 是：

```text
PARTIAL_PASS
```

原因：

```text
总体达到 80%，但 green_on_red 仍差 1/20 episode 才达到 75%。
剩余瓶颈仍是 cube2 grasp robustness，而不是 language/perception/gate/planner。
```

