```text
relative_pose_gripper_to_top
relative_pose_top_to_bottom
goal_delta
reached_goal_delta
initial_goal_error
current_goal_error
progress_scalar
stalled_steps
placement_bin
```

2. Pure goal feature utilities：

```text
src/vlm_nsm/data/stage20_goal_features.py
```

实现函数：

```text
compute_relative_pose(a_pose, b_pose)
compute_placement_bin(top_pose, bottom_pose, center_threshold=0.025)
compute_goal_delta(phase, current_state, target_spec)
compute_reached_goal_delta(phase_start_state, current_state, fields=None)
compute_goal_error(goal_delta)
compute_progress_scalar(initial_error, current_error, clip=True, eps=1e-8)
compute_stalled_steps(error_history, tolerance=1e-3)
```

特性：

```text
numpy-only
no Robosuite dependency
pose supports list/tuple/np.ndarray/dict
xyz required, orientation optional
unsupported phase raises ValueError
progress clipped to [0, 1] by default
