### Stage 20-E: Goal-Conditioned MLP Baseline (2026-05-28)

**当前状态**:

```text
Stage 20-E = STRONG_PASS for offline supervised validation
Robosuite rollout = not run
Qwen/DashScope = not run
ACT/diffusion/VQ = not run
canonical checkpoint/config = untouched
Stage 19 results = not overwritten
```

**目标**:

验证 Stage 20-D 生成的 role-conditioned feature pipeline 是否有离线监督学习价值：

```text
obs + role_state + goal_delta + reached_goal_delta + progress + phase -> action
```

这不是最终 controller 训练，只是 offline BC action prediction baseline。

**新增文件**:

```text
src/vlm_nsm/data/stage20_role_conditioned_dataset.py
src/vlm_nsm/training/__init__.py
src/vlm_nsm/training/train_stage20_goal_conditioned_mlp.py
