```text
generated/results/stage_20/obs_only_mlp_v0_1/
generated/results/stage_20/goal_conditioned_mlp_v0_1/
generated/results/stage_20/stage20_e_goal_mlp_report.md
```

每个训练目录包含：

```text
best.pt
last.pt
config.json
train_log.jsonl
metrics.json
loss_curve.json
```

**Dataset loader**:

```text
src/vlm_nsm/data/stage20_role_conditioned_dataset.py
```

支持：

```text
split = train / val / all
feature_mode = obs_only / goal_conditioned
normalization using normalization_stats.json
manifest-based split indices
finite tensor validation
goal_delta_mask
reached_goal_delta_mask
phase one-hot
```

Feature modes：

```text
obs_only:
  flatten(obs_history)

goal_conditioned:
  flatten(obs_history)
  + flatten(role_state_history)
  + flatten(goal_delta_history)
  + flatten(goal_delta_mask)
  + flatten(reached_goal_delta_history)
  + flatten(reached_goal_delta_mask)
  + flatten(progress_scalar_history)
  + flatten(phase_id one-hot)
```

**训练设置**:

```text
dataset_dir = generated/datasets/stage_20/role_conditioned_stack_skill_dataset_v0_1
epochs = 50
batch_size = 256
lr = 1e-3
hidden_dim = 256
num_layers = 2
seed = 0
requested_device = cuda
actual_device = cpu fallback
```

