### Stage 20-Z: DAgger Iteration 2 (2026-05-30)

**状态**: **EXCELLENT_PASS**。Ever lift 0→10%→80%, dim6 maintained 100%, XY remains bottleneck。

**Z1**: 30-episode Iter2 recording (Stage 20-Y checkpoint): 28,683 features, dim6_close=100%, ever_lift=6/30, xy_agree=14-81%。

**Z2**: Iter2 correction dataset: 28,593 windows, dim6_disagree=11.3% (down from 58%!), xy_disagree=73.3%。

**Z3**: Mixed Iter2 dataset: 252,785 windows (50K base + 60K Y×3 + 143K Z×5)。

**Z4**: Iter2 LSTM: best_val=0.139, best_epoch=3（early stop，数据多样性强）。

**Z5**: 20-episode rerun — DAgger 迭代对比：

| Metric | Stage 20-W (pre) | Stage 20-Y (Iter1) | Stage 20-Z (Iter2) | Trend |
|--------|-----------------|-------------------|-------------------|-------|
| Success | 0/20 | 0/10 | 0/20 | — |
| **Ever lift** | **0/20** | **1/10 (10%)** | **16/20 (80%)** | **↑↑** |
