| dim6 sign agree | 37.2% | 97-100% | 29-100% | varies |
| Unsafe leak | 0 | 0 | 0 | ✅ |

**关键突破**：
1. **Ever lift 从0→80%**: DAgger Iter2 让模型在80%的episodes中成功通过grasp到达lift阶段
2. **dim6修复保持**: 98-100% learned close rate maintained across DAgger iterations
3. **XY仍是瓶颈**: dim6_sign 在29-100%波动 — lift之后XY控制仍需改进
4. **dim6_disagree从58%→11%**: Iter2数据中dim6 disagreement大幅下降，说明dim6问题基本解决

**产出**: `stage20_z_dagger_iter2_correction_dataset/` (28.6K), `stage20_z_dagger_iter2_mixed_dataset/` (252.8K), `goal_conditioned_lstm_stage20_z_dagger_iter2_mixed/best.pt`, `stage20_z_iter2_gated_rerun/`

